      "id": "claim_d5b90b5ec51a47b4855e9216ecfb7976",
      "statement": "itest-up.sh creates or reuses a kind cluster, starts the podman-compose localstack stack, waits for both to become healthy, applies fixtures (a pull secret and a Prometheus deployment) from integration/fixtures/, and waits for at least two Prometheus alert-evaluation cycles before returning ready.",
