      "id": "claim_b979ccb8b558499f9994fcd2fce20a7f",
      "statement": "components/trusted-actions/tests/mock-backplane/ is a standalone fake Backplane API server built on the Imposter mock engine, started via `make mock-backplane` (Imposter Go native engine v5, auto-restart disabled) listening on MOCK_BACKPLANE_PORT (default 8087), using in-memory state that resets on restart and fixture cluster data in data/cluster.json keyed by {clusterId}:{kubernetes path} with declared RBAC identity (API group, resource, namespace) per entry.",
