    {
      "id": "claim_8147c99e42a843ff964b17f356857ca2",
      "statement": "Trusted Actions' Tekton PipelineRun definitions (.tekton/rosa-trusted-actions-pull-request.yaml and .tekton/rosa-trusted-actions-push.yaml) exist in this monorepo, are adapted for components/trusted-actions (repo annotation, path-context, pathChanged() filters), and as currently written their pipelinesascode.tekton.dev/on-cel-expression triggers are plain CEL conditions (not prefixed with `false &&` or otherwise unconditionally disabled) that fire on pull_request/push events to main whose changed paths match components/trusted-actions/*** or the pipeline's own .tekton file; both files retain the comment '# Enable only at the coordinated cutover after checking the shared image/release destination' directly above the expression, which records prior pre-cutover intent but is not enforced by the YAML itself, so live/firing CI status must be verified against the current Konflux source/image bindings rather than inferred from this file content alone.",
